        <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span>-based <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> Suffer from Hallucinations: A Survey of Taxonomy, Methods, and Directions
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lin%2C+X">Xixun Lin</a>, 
      
