      <span class="has-text-grey-dark mathjax">16 pages, 3 figures, 4 tables. Code available at https://github.com/wocqcm2/TERAG</span>
    </p>
    

    

    
  </li>

  <li class="arxiv-result">
    <div class="is-marginless">
      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.18666">arXiv:2509.18666</a>
